Well, I went into wizard mode to make sure:
 - Sting is an artifact even if not yet identified as an elven sword. (Did
   turn light blue.)
 - Artifacts are still artifacts even after cancellation. (lose bonuses
   though.)
 - A wand with 0 charges, will work once then disintegrate.
 - A wand with -1 charges (made with a wand of cancellation) will
   not work, then disintegrage anyway.

